          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">If this model is slain, before removing it from the battlefield, the players must roll off. The winner picks a point on the battlefield up to 3&quot; from this model. Inflict D3 mortal damage on each enemy unit within 2&quot; of that point. This model is then removed from the battlefield.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
